1
00:00:00,997 --> 00:00:03,957
- Raj, that's incredible.
- Congratulations.

2
00:00:04,126 --> 00:00:09,466
Excuse me, 30 what under 30 what
to watch what?

3
00:00:09,881 --> 00:00:12,301
(Raj:)Thirty visionaries
under 30 years of age to watch...

4
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:15,677
(Raj:)...as they challenge
the preconceptions of the fields.

5
00:00:15,846 --> 00:00:18,846
(Sheldon:)If I had a million guesses,
I never would have gotten that.

6
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:23,313
They've got me in with a guy doing
something about hunger in Indonesia...

7
00:00:23,478 --> 00:00:26,568
...a psychotherapist using dolphins
to rehabilitate prisoners...

8
00:00:26,731 --> 00:00:31,361
(Raj:)...and Ellen Page,
star of the charming independent film Juno.

9
00:00:31,778 --> 00:00:34,568
(Howard:)Oh, I'd so do her.

10
00:00:36,032 --> 00:00:38,452
(Leonard:)You'd do the dolphins.

11
00:00:39,119 --> 00:00:40,199
Do I get a mention...

12
00:00:40,370 --> 00:00:43,250
(Howard:)...for designing the telescope camera
mounting bracket?

13
00:00:43,415 --> 00:00:46,455
(Raj:)Sorry, it's not part of my heartwarming
and personal narrative...

14
00:00:46,626 --> 00:00:48,796
(Raj:)...in which a humble boy
from New Delhi...

15
00:00:48,962 --> 00:00:53,382
(Raj:)...overcame poverty and prejudice and
journeyed to America to reach for the stars.

16
00:00:53,550 --> 00:00:57,140
Poverty? Your father's a gynecologist.
He drives a Bentley.

17
00:00:58,096 --> 00:01:02,026
(Raj:)It's a lease.

